{"c":{"147089":["Dabao Ji","Male","b147089-ITLt2gV78acI.png","He found Seven on a beach 2 years ago and saved his life, but because of this, he's now covered in medical bills that he has to pay off. To pay for them all, he attempts to put Seven into all kinds of odd jobs, but eventually pushes him into an assassinating job.",276],"147091":["Kele","Female","b147091-zLwuSVKLkajf.png","",145],"147092":["Shisan Meihua","Female","b147092-vZwfvoDCO71h.png","Thirteen is a mysterious masked assassin, anti-hero, and the thirteenth daughter of the Plum Blossom swordsman. Having been trained as a cold-blooded assassin, Thirteen is first seen as a detached and cool headed person but also prideful of her skills.",608],"147093":["Liuqi Wu","Male","b147093-o39WBmBYj5Z1.png","He's a 21-year-old barber who suffers from amnesia. Alongside his boss _(and best friend)_ Dai Bo and Xiao Fei, works as an assassin for hire to gain a lot of yuan to retrieve his lost memory.",1148],"147094":["Xiaomi Mao","Female","b147094-fi9ZAEKq29ty.png","",5],"147096":["Sitan Guo Wangzi","Male","b147096-svrlF7WW6G6B.png","",16],"147097":["Dachun He","Male","b147097-y8IrmTbj8223.png","",153],"147098":["Feng Wang","Male","b147098-uaDVdGHZwvFx.png","",13],"147099":["Xiaofei Ji",null,"b147099-4PNOfwhm9Deo.png","Xiao Fei is the son of Da Fei and adoptive son of Dai Bo. He's a flying chicken and always follows Seven around. Dai Bo introduces Xiao Fei to Seven as a means to fly away from tough situations.",222],"227628":["Sitan Guo Xiao Jiqiren",null,"b227628-nzuiwbwRMeiV.png","",0],"227635":["Shaokao Tan Laoban","Male","b227635-CH4OwKhwYbCY.jpg","",0],"227642":["Huilian Jiang","Female","b227642-n9cmkmA3Ibro.png","",26],"227644":["Neiku Nian","Male","b227644-SCHSvz4BLILm.png","",1],"227646":["Chen Apo","Female","b227646-rKelaKn0jAYY.png","",2],"227647":["Xiaolong Chen","Male","b227647-Tx1oPFIOLGbs.png","",0],"227649":["Chen Bo","Male","b227649-7ul1DFyA7m7T.png","",7],"227666":["Ajie","Male","b227666-SZTZUpLdz9JY